# What EAS Build uploads. Paths are relative to THIS directory — the git repo
# root — because that is what eas-cli archives, and it reads `.easignore` from
# `git rev-parse --show-toplevel`, not from the app directory.
#
# WHY THIS FILE EXISTS
# --------------------
# The root .gitignore excludes `ios/` and `android/` with no leading slash, so
# those patterns match a directory of that name at ANY depth. That silently
# swallowed `mobile/modules/plannplate-share-target/ios` and `.../android` — the
# native half of the local Expo module. The files were present locally, so
# `expo-modules-autolinking resolve` found them and every local check passed,
# but they never reached the build server. The pod was never installed, the
# native module never registered, and on device the share extension saved links
# the app could never read. Two builds went to the wrong theory before the build
# log showed 194 pods with no `PlanNplateShareTarget` among them.
#
# IT HAPPENED AGAIN (Sept 2026, commit 08cb650): this file was rewritten with
# unanchored `ios/` and `android/`, and Android dev build 71 shipped without the
# module — shares opened the app but never imported. NEVER write a bare `ios/`
# or `android/` here; always anchor them as `mobile/ios/` and `mobile/android/`.
# Verify after any change: the Android build log must contain
# `:plannplate-share-target:` Gradle tasks.
#
# IMPORTANT: when `.easignore` exists, eas-cli ignores EVERY `.gitignore` in the
# repo — including mobile/.gitignore. So this file alone decides the upload, and
# anything the .gitignores were protecting has to be restated here. Two things
# that matter most: `.env*` (secrets, and Expo loads them at build time, which
# would change the values baked into the app) and `mobile/patches/` (an INPUT —
# `postinstall: patch-package` needs it).

# ── Dependencies and build output ───────────────────────────────────────────
**/node_modules/
**/.expo/
**/dist/
**/web-build/
**/.metro-health-check*
**/*.tsbuildinfo
mobile/expo-env.d.ts

# ── Prebuild output ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# ANCHORED to the app directory (NEVER use bare ios/ or android/)
mobile/ios/
mobile/android/
**/.kotlin/

# ── Secrets and signing material ────────────────────────────────────────────
**/.env*
!**/.env*.example
**/*.jks
**/*.p8
**/*.p12
**/*.key
**/*.pem
**/*.mobileprovision

# ── Non-mobile project folders & large archive artifacts ────────────────────
backend/
admin/
__MACOSX/
pdf_images/
PlannPlate Inspired/
*.zip

# ── Large local artefacts (40 MB of patch files alone) ──────────────────────
diff.patch
init.patch
**/graphify-out/
/*.png
changelog.txt

# Explicitly keep mobile patches for patch-package
!mobile/patches/
!mobile/patches/**

# ── Logs and debug leftovers ────────────────────────────────────────────────
**/*.log
**/npm-debug.*
**/yarn-debug.*
**/yarn-error.*
mobile/decompressed_log.txt
mobile/parsed_log.txt
mobile/messages.txt
mobile/eas_log*.txt
mobile/eas_log*.jsonl
mobile/eas_full_logs.txt
mobile/error_summary*.txt
mobile/final_error.txt
mobile/last_build*.json
mobile/plan-setup-preview.html
mobile/welcome-preview.html

# ── Editor / OS / tooling ───────────────────────────────────────────────────
**/.DS_Store
**/Thumbs.db
**/.vscode/
**/.idea/
**/.claude/
**/.agents/
**/.gemini/
**/.playwright-mcp/
**/.supabase/
